### Health Check

GET http://localhost:4002/health


### Create Order

POST http://localhost:4002/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerName":"Arnav",
    "restaurantId":1,
    "items":[
        {
            "name":"Burger",
            "quantity":2,
            "price":250
        },
        {
            "name":"Pizza",
            "quantity":1,
            "price":400
        }
    ]
}


### Get Orders

GET http://localhost:4002/api/orders


### Get Order

GET http://localhost:4002/api/orders/1


### Cancel Order

PATCH http://localhost:4002/api/orders/1/cancel